  {
    "elementId": "tRhhY2dMcLMA5U0HhOIQp",
    "content": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "You are newcomers to Saltmere, a hard little fishing town on a grey northern coast. Forty years ago a storm drowned half of it; the townsfolk still won't talk about Old Saltmere. Lately the tide has gone strangely far out, and three fishermen have vanished. The harbourmaster is offering 50 gold pieces to anyone who can bring them home."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "attrs": {
                "src": "media:img-welcome-1"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Character options: any official species and class is welcome. Characters start at 1st level with standard array or point buy. Good backgrounds for this campaign: Sailor, Fisher, Acolyte, Guard. Every character should have a reason to need money - or a reason to care about a missing fisherman."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Safety tools: we use lines and veils and the X-card. This campaign includes drowning, body horror and religious cults."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Handout: The Notice on the Harbour Post"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "attrs": {
                "src": "media:img-welcome-2"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
